{"status":"unsupported_domain","encoding":"verislop.formalizer-ast/0.1","reason":"The specified behavior cannot be faithfully expressed using the supplied typed AST grammar and executable Python test bridge. No complete contract is proposed.","gaps":[{"obligations":["D1","A1","O4","O5","O6","I1"],"detail":"Event and output values require the actual integer-or-null type. The supplied Sort grammar has no nullable or option sort, and substituting a record or Except representation would change the specified JSON structure."},{"obligations":["O2","O6"],"detail":"The frontend explicitly excludes sorting and supplies no lexicographic String comparison. It therefore cannot express the required lexicographically sorted distinct group names for arbitrary Unicode strings."},{"obligations":["O3","O4","O5","O6","I1"],"detail":"The supplied total acyclic term grammar has no range-generation operation or recursion for constructing an arbitrary number of buckets from start, end and width. Existing list operations cannot generate the required buckets for a group with only one event and arbitrarily many bucket starts."},{"obligations":["O1","R1"],"detail":"The supplied formula grammar cannot directly express the Python source location, standard-library-only imports, or absence of observable side effects and external I/O. These requirements need registered implementation checks."}],"preserved_obligations":["D1","A1","O1","O2","O3","O4","O5","O6","O7","I1","R1"],"required_extension":"Provide registered nullable Int semantics preserving JSON null, lexicographic String ordering and distinct sorting, bounded arithmetic range generation, and implementation checks for solution.py, purity, imports and external I/O. Opaque Lean source cannot substitute for the requested executable TESTED assurance."}